3. FONT  (data/font/: MPLUSRounded1c-Medium.ttf and the atlas baked from it,
          uk_atlas.resS.bin and uk_rects.json)
   SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see data/font/OFL.txt.

   Copyright 2016 The Rounded M+ Project Authors.
   The baked atlas is a modified version of this font and is distributed under
   the same licence.


NOT INCLUDED

This repository contains no files from the game. The installer modifies a copy
you already own. Besides the translation and the font, it carries 85 images in
which the game's own artwork has Ukrainian lettering in place of the original;
that artwork remains Silver Lining Studio's.

Behind the Frame: The Finest Scenery is © Silver Lining Studio. This project is
an unofficial community translation and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
the studio or its publisher.
